sec.p:
The errors in SST and δ18Osw in this study was estimated using equations proposed by Mohtadi et al.3. The errors in SST and δ18Osw are about ±1.03 °C and ±0.23‰, respectively. The error estimation for SST is carried out by propagating the errors introduced by the equation proposed by Anand et al.70 and Mg/Ca measurement. The SST error estimation is given as3:1\documentclass[12pt]{minimal}
